### Добавление TXT-записи api_test для поддомена *.example.com Timeweb
POST https://api.timeweb.ru/v1.2/accounts/{{login}}/domains/{{domain}}/user-records/
accept: */*
x-app-key: {{appkey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "subdomain": "*",
        "value": "api_test"
    },
    "ttl": {{ttl}},
    "type": "TXT"
}


### Добавление TXT-записи api_test для самого домена example.com Timeweb
POST https://api.timeweb.ru/v1.2/accounts/{{login}}/domains/{{domain}}/user-records/
accept: */*
x-app-key: {{appkey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "subdomain": null,
        "value": "api_test"
    },
    "ttl": {{ttl}},
    "type": "TXT"
}
